  "description": "Western Goldrush is a bold vintage display font inspired by old western signage, frontier typography, and classic gold rush era aesthetics. With its decorative serif details, rugged character shapes, and nostalgic old-town presence, this typeface captures the spirit of the Wild West with a strong and memorable style. The font blends traditional western influence with bold readability, making it perfect for posters, branding, packaging, logos, saloon-style graphics, book covers, apparel designs, and themed event promotions. \nWhether you’re creating cowboy-inspired branding or retro Americana visuals, this font brings timeless frontier energy to your typography.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Western Goldrush is a bold vintage display font inspired by old western signage, frontier typography, and classic gold rush era aesthetics. With its decorative serif details, rugged character shapes, and nostalgic old-town presence, this typeface captures the spirit of the Wild West with a strong and memorable style. The font blends traditional western influence with bold readability, making it perfect for posters, branding, packaging, logos, saloon-style graphics, book covers, apparel designs, and themed event promotions. </p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating cowboy-inspired branding or retro Americana visuals, this font brings timeless frontier energy to your typography.</p>",
